      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Provider Choice**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the specific provider for this implementation. The goal is to demonstrate resource resolution, and I'll focus on the model resource type within Vertex AI. This choice gives me a concrete starting point to illustrate the provider-specific aspects of the task.\n\n\n**Choosing Vertex AI Resource**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on Vertex AI's model resource. My immediate focus is coding a Python script, `select_platform_resource.py`. I'll use the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library to resolve a generic model name into a Vertex AI model path. This should effectively demonstrate the core concept.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887427996,
          "start": 1789887425646
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd9aac6e001RE2EaYN5H6Q7Av",
